# Preview links (`/preview/*`)

Workers Assets uses `not_found_handling = "single-page-application"`. A missing preview path returns **homepage** `index.html` with **200** — it looks like “the live link only opens the main page.”

## When sharing or linking a mockup/preview

1. Prefer an **explicit HTML file**:
   - Good: `https://japaneselanguagementor.com/preview/hw-notes-deck/index.html`
   - Good: `https://japaneselanguagementor.com/preview/something.html`
   - Risky: `/preview/hw-notes-deck/` (directory only) — Worker now resolves `index.html`, but always verify.
2. After deploy, **curl the URL** and check `<title>` is the preview title — not `Japanese Language Mentor — Learn Japanese with JD`.
3. Never assume a folder URL works until that check passes.

## Worker behavior

`/preview/*` (except Harris/JEM special hosts) resolves directory paths to `…/index.html` and **blocks** homepage SPA fallback (404 HTML instead of the marketing home).
